# SPA fallback for client-side routing.
# Cloudflare Pages serves dist/404.html (a copy of index.html, see the build script)
# for any unknown path, so every client-side route renders. A "/index 200" rewrite
# does NOT work: Pages answers /index with a 308 to /, which loses the route
# (verified live 8 Sep 2026 on /demo, /login, /admin, /reset-password).
